@googleIdToken =
@googleNonce =
@backend = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@accessToken = PEGA_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN
@adminToken = PEGA_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN_ADMIN
@date = 2026-10-02
@eventId = PEGA_EL_UUID_INTERNO_DEL_EVENTO
@betId = PEGA_EL_UUID_DEL_SEGUIMIENTO
@apiSportsKey = PEGA_LA_CLAVE_SOLO_PARA_PRUEBAS_DEL_PROVEEDOR

### Login cliente local
POST {{backend}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo","password":"demo-change-me"}

### Deportes y mercados
GET {{backend}}/api/v1/tracking/sports
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Partidos de una fecha UTC
GET {{backend}}/api/v1/tracking/events?sport=NFL&date={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Snapshot de un partido
GET {{backend}}/api/v1/tracking/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Jugadores y estadísticas que pueden seleccionarse
GET {{backend}}/api/v1/tracking/events/{{eventId}}/players
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Registrar recepción Over 4.5 de DK Metcalf para el evento capturado
POST {{backend}}/api/v1/tracking/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{eventId}}","market":"PLAYER_RECEPTIONS","selection":"OVER","line":4.5,"playerId":"1645"}

### Mis seguimientos
GET {{backend}}/api/v1/tracking/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Un seguimiento
GET {{backend}}/api/v1/tracking/bets/{{betId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Plan y permisos
GET {{backend}}/api/v1/subscriptions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Diagnóstico para ADMIN, sin llamada al proveedor
GET {{backend}}/api/v1/admin/mybet/provider
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### API-Sports: catálogo crudo, consume cuota al ejecutarse
GET https://v1.american-football.api-sports.io/games?date={{date}}&league=1&timezone=UTC
x-apisports-key: {{apiSportsKey}}

### API-Sports: estadísticas crudas del evento capturado
GET https://v1.american-football.api-sports.io/games/statistics/players?id=21561
x-apisports-key: {{apiSportsKey}}

### API-Sports: cobertura NFL
GET https://v1.american-football.api-sports.io/leagues?id=1
x-apisports-key: {{apiSportsKey}}

### API-Sports: ejemplo de recurso restringido por el plan Free
GET https://v1.american-football.api-sports.io/players?team=9&season=2026
x-apisports-key: {{apiSportsKey}}

### Iniciar acceso Google (cliente OAuth Web requerido)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/google/challenge

### Acceder o registrar cliente Google (variables sin credenciales)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "{{googleIdToken}}",
  "nonce": "{{googleNonce}}"
}
